00:23:25.710 --> 00:23:29.260
Next Peacemaker Kurogane

00:23:26.330 --> 00:23:28.160
<i>Mr. Hijikata, you must be tired.</i>

00:23:28.160 --> 00:23:29.980
<i>Well, please have a good long rest.</i>

00:23:29.980 --> 00:23:30.720
<i>What?</i>...

00:23:30.720 --> 00:23:33.470
<i>I will take care of everything else.</i>

00:23:33.470 --> 00:23:37.880
